## Catalog (read the group file before building a component from it)

Files live in `.cursor/reference/components/`. Each row there gives the component's anatomy/variants, behavior/states, and its mobile · tablet · desktop layout.

| | File | Components |
|-|------|------------|
| A | `reference/components/foundations.md` | Colors, Themes, Backgrounds, Typography, Paragraph, Text alignment, Alignment (layout), Margin & padding, … |
| B | `reference/components/layout.md` | Page, PageContent, Section, Grid layout, Panels (left/right), Footers, Component page, Hero, … |
| C | `reference/components/navigation.md` | Navbar, SubNavbar, Toolbar, Tabs, TabBar, TabPage, Breadcrumb, Back, … |
| D | `reference/components/actions.md` | Button, Alert, Loader, Progress, Stepper progress, Tooltip, Banner, Undo snackbar, … |
| E | `reference/components/overlays.md` | Modal, Popup, Popover, Dropdown menu, Overlay / Drawer, Bottom sheet / Action sheet, Lightbox, Share sheet, … |
| F | `reference/components/inputs.md` | Forms, Calendar picker UI, Time picker UI, Date-time, Search, Autocomplete, Dropdown selection, Selection page, … |
| G | `reference/components/lists.md` | List, Media list, Blog list, Product list, Feeds layout, Card, Ticket card, Chip / Badge / Avatar, … |
| H | `reference/components/media.md` | Image, Slides, Player (play), Camera, Chart (graph), Upload, Gallery / Media grid, QR / Barcode, … |
| I | `reference/components/network.md` | NetworkTree, LegSummary, TeamList, ReferralLink, CommissionTable, EarningsSummary, RankBadge / Progress, Compensation plan page, … |
