| J | `reference/components/hooks.md` | useViewClass, useDisclosure, useDebounce, useInfiniteScroll, useToast, useForm, PageTransition, cn(), … |

## Do not
- Build a component outside this organization, or a second copy of one that exists (add a variant, or override with `className` per §1b)
- Edit a component's internals for a one-off look, or apply a `className` override that is not written in the content's `Overrides:` line
- Ship a component without states, keyboard support, and its entry on the component page
- Use `position: absolute` without a `relative` parent, ad-hoc z-index numbers, or page-level horizontal scroll
- Show a wide table or full tree on mobile — use the mobile layout in the catalog
- Build the `network/` group when the concept has no networking/marketing plan
